00:12:24,347 --> 00:12:28,351
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You didn't say, "I wanna
see you too," or anything.</font>

163
00:12:28,435 --> 00:12:30,812
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I thought... you'd be the
type to say that is all</font>

164
00:12:30,896 --> 00:12:33,315
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Well, I'm not!</font>

165
00:12:34,983 --> 00:12:36,860
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Today... is a great day.</font>

166
00:12:40,614 --> 00:12:45,285
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Not only do I have my friends
over, I get to see Kazehaya too.</font>

167
00:12:51,041 --> 00:12:54,252
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yo, finally.</font>

168
00:12:56,630 --> 00:13:01,676
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm... done for.</font>

169
00:13:03,929 --> 00:13:06,014
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- This place is disgusting.
- This place is disgusting.</font>

170
00:13:13,188 --> 00:13:16,858
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Okay. Tell me. How are
things looking, doc?</font>

171
00:13:16,942 --> 00:13:21,404
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Awful. Let's put these
covers on you for starters.</font>

172
00:13:22,489 --> 00:13:23,323
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">A cold.</font>

173
00:13:23,406 --> 00:13:26,910
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- It's a cold.
- It's literally just a cold.</font>

174
00:13:26,993 --> 00:13:30,539
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">For now, I kinda... brought
you a variety of things.</font>

175
00:13:31,414 --> 00:13:32,833
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Exorcism tools?</font>

176
00:13:33,959 --> 00:13:40,006
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- I'll do it!
- And also this... I can feed him!</font>

177
00:13:42,259 --> 00:13:43,468
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}This too...</font>

178
00:13:46,263 --> 00:13:47,597
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And...</font>

179
00:13:47,681 --> 00:13:52,269
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, come on. Why am I taking
care of Pin like we're dating?</font>

180
00:13:52,352 --> 00:13:53,895
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What a caretaker!</font>

181
00:13:54,437 --> 00:13:57,440
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey, you think I'm okay?</font>

182
00:14:00,193 --> 00:14:03,738
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- You think this room's okay?
- The heck are you even growling at, Pedro?</font>

183
00:14:03,822 --> 00:14:07,367
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Just last night, I heard this
high-pitched screech, like something was</font>

184
00:14:07,450 --> 00:14:10,328
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">scratching.</font>

185
00:14:10,412 --> 00:14:13,331
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The fever's so bad, his ears are
ringing! Don't worry. Please just relax</font>

186
00:14:13,415 --> 00:14:17,002
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}and get some sleep.</font>

187
00:14:17,085 --> 00:14:22,465
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">This room... may take a little work, but
I'll be sure to give it a proper cleaning</font>

188
00:14:22,549 --> 00:14:25,969
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">while you rest. It's fine. I'm
actually very good at this sort of thing.</font>

189
00:14:26,052 --> 00:14:29,472
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Warding off evil spirits?</font>

190
00:14:30,015 --> 00:14:31,683
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Cleaning... is fun.</font>

191
00:14:33,101 --> 00:14:35,896
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey, want me to tell you a
bedtime story to lull you to sleep?</font>

192
00:14:35,979 --> 00:14:38,815
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh? Okay. Why not.</font>

193
00:14:42,444 --> 00:14:46,281
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Then here's one I just picked up
recently. It's a true story, and it</font>

194
00:14:46,364 --> 00:14:50,201
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">actually happened in this very
neighborhood. It all started at this</font>

195
00:14:50,285 --> 00:14:54,039
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">single guy's apartment, he would
hear a knock on his door every night.</font>

196
00:14:54,122 --> 00:14:58,919
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But when he swung the door open, there was
never anyone standing on the other side.</font>

197
00:14:59,002 --> 00:15:03,882
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And that's because, in reality,
all along, at that very apartment...</font>

198
00:15:14,225 --> 00:15:17,270
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Despite getting all freaked
out, he's sleeping like a baby.</font>

199
00:15:20,941 --> 00:15:23,109
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's a miniature Kazehaya!</font>

200
00:15:23,818 --> 00:15:27,489
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's my fault! I'm so
sorry. I violated your privacy...</font>

201
00:15:27,572 --> 00:15:31,242
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No! it's just it's embarrassing!</font>

202
00:15:33,912 --> 00:15:38,166
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">In that one... I was just
frustrated that we lost the game.</font>

203
00:15:40,919 --> 00:15:44,089
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And Pin was making fun of me for crying.</font>

204
00:15:44,172 --> 00:15:45,507
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Just one more look?</font>

205
00:15:45,590 --> 00:15:49,636
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No! You can't! Oh! You haven't
gotten to pet Maru yet, right?</font>

206
00:15:49,719 --> 00:15:53,807
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's just I'd feel bad if I
got between him and Sanada!</font>

207
00:15:53,890 --> 00:15:56,434
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- W-What about now then?
- S-Sure!</font>

208
00:15:56,518 --> 00:15:59,729
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Why don't they just get together already?
- Why don't they just get together already?</font>

209
00:16:02,816 --> 00:16:04,985
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sooo cuuuute!</font>

210
00:16:06,903 --> 00:16:08,655
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">He's out cold, huh?</font>

211
00:16:08,738 --> 00:16:09,739
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Mmhm, sure is.</font>

212
00:16:11,825 --> 00:16:15,870
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- I feel lighter.
- The medicine must've kicked in.</font>

213
00:16:15,954 --> 00:16:20,000
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Even the air feels different now!
- Because we ventilated the room.</font>

214
00:16:20,083 --> 00:16:23,628
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Because we ventilated the room.</font>

215
00:16:23,712 --> 00:16:27,674
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You're amazing! Next time I'm
possessed, I'll count on you!</font>

216
00:16:27,757 --> 00:16:32,554
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}What? You guys're
still loafing around here?</font>

217
00:16:32,637 --> 00:16:35,015
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}- Wha...
- Wha...</font>

218
00:16:36,141 --> 00:16:39,144
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">We're leavin' you for dead next time!</font>

219
00:16:39,227 --> 00:16:41,896
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- T- take care.
- Unbelievable. Well</font>

220
00:16:41,980 --> 00:16:44,649
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- that was a total waste.
- Hey, I know there's not much I can do to</font>

221
00:16:44,733 --> 00:16:47,360
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">repay you, but if you need advice, come
ask me.</font>

222
00:16:47,444 --> 00:16:50,488
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Just sayin' if it's about Shota or Ryu, I
know it all. Wanna learn their weaknesses?</font>

223
00:16:50,572 --> 00:16:53,700
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I got you.</font>

224
00:16:55,452 --> 00:16:58,288
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That jerk better not be
telling her anything about me.</font>

225
00:16:58,371 --> 00:17:01,249
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And Shota...</font>

226
00:17:01,875 --> 00:17:05,420
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- I-Is that true?
- Completely! If you wanna thank him,</font>

227
00:17:05,503 --> 00:17:09,049
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">that's the way. He'll be thrilled!</font>

228
00:17:09,716 --> 00:17:10,925
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">He'd be thrilled?</font>

229
00:17:15,722 --> 00:17:20,060
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But, man, I feel light as a feather,
this is the beeeest! What, did they forget</font>

230
00:17:20,143 --> 00:17:24,522
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">something?</font>

231
00:17:46,628 --> 00:17:49,422
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako, your cake was so freakin' yummy!</font>

232
00:17:49,506 --> 00:17:52,842
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Well, things didn't quite go
as planned, But we'll try again!</font>

233
00:17:52,926 --> 00:17:56,221
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yes please! Come again!</font>

234
00:17:56,304 --> 00:18:01,643
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You know... after being together pretty
much all day, leaving's kinda hard.</font>

235
00:18:05,772 --> 00:18:08,942
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The more time we spend with one
another, it becomes harder and harder to</font>

236
00:18:09,025 --> 00:18:12,195
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">say goodbye.</font>

237
00:18:13,279 --> 00:18:17,659
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">'Kay. I'll be going this way.
See you guys. Get back safe.</font>

238
00:18:17,742 --> 00:18:20,411
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Well aren't you gonna walk her home?</font>

239
00:18:20,495 --> 00:18:23,665
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah, that's right! It's
dangerous when it's this dark out!</font>

240
00:18:23,748 --> 00:18:26,918
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's fine! I-I'll make sure not to
scare anyone on the way back. I'll be</font>

241
00:18:27,001 --> 00:18:30,130
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- extra careful!
- I'll go.</font>

242
00:18:32,590 --> 00:18:33,508
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Okay?</font>

243
00:18:34,467 --> 00:18:35,385
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But I...</font>

244
00:18:35,468 --> 00:18:38,138
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No? If you don't want me to...</font>

245
00:18:38,221 --> 00:18:41,391
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's not that I don't.</font>

246
00:18:46,229 --> 00:18:48,523
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If Shota's going, then I'll go.</font>

247
00:18:48,606 --> 00:18:53,653
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Idiot! You're coming with us.
- Pedro...</font>

248
00:18:55,530 --> 00:18:57,824
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- See ya!
- Good night!</font>

249
00:18:57,907 --> 00:19:00,201
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Give our regards to your mom and dad!
- I- I will!</font>

250
00:19:02,370 --> 00:19:03,413
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Let's go.</font>

251
00:19:09,419 --> 00:19:13,631
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Of course I want this.
There's no way I wouldn't.</font>

252
00:19:13,715 --> 00:19:16,593
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- The days are starting to get short.
- Yeah...</font>

253
00:19:17,927 --> 00:19:18,970
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm happy.</font>

254
00:19:20,722 --> 00:19:24,559
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Maybe even too happy... to the point where
I want to thank you so much, but I just</font>

255
00:19:24,642 --> 00:19:28,605
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">can't find the words.</font>

256
00:19:28,688 --> 00:19:31,065
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Or even look you in the eyes.</font>

257
00:20:06,017 --> 00:20:10,605
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Whoa!
- Whoa!</font>

258
00:20:10,688 --> 00:20:15,276
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- You! I-I Uuuuh!
- Uh- so- just now was that~ Huh?!</font>

259
00:20:15,360 --> 00:20:19,447
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Um, Mr. Arai said that if I wanted to
thank you, I should grab you, then close</font>

260
00:20:19,530 --> 00:20:23,660
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- my eyes and count all the way up to five.
- That rat bastard...</font>

261
00:20:26,955 --> 00:20:28,206
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Be careful, kay?</font>

262
00:20:30,291 --> 00:20:35,296
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's just, if you try that again,
I don't know how I might react.</font>

263
00:20:35,380 --> 00:20:37,632
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I really don't know what I'd do.</font>

264
00:20:43,221 --> 00:20:47,225
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The more... the more I hear his voice.</font>

265
00:20:48,226 --> 00:20:49,894
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Spend time with him...</font>

266
00:20:51,562 --> 00:20:53,731
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Catch glimpses of his face...</font>

267
00:20:56,818 --> 00:21:00,822
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I was right... the harder
it becomes to say goodbye.</font>

268
00:21:00,905 --> 00:21:05,243
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Just for a little, don't look at me 'kay?
- Okay...</font>

269
00:21:07,412 --> 00:21:13,084
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">One day... will I want to tell him
the way I was feeling... on this night?</font>

270
00:22:27,116 --> 00:22:28,659
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Winter is coming.</font>

271
00:22:29,327 --> 00:22:31,204
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The footsteps of hope.</font>

272
00:22:32,163 --> 00:22:34,540
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Next time: "Chizuru's Love"</font>
